script:pre-request {
  req.setHeader("X-Api-Key", bru.interpolate("{{api_key}}"));
}

docs {
  Flows against the local docker compose stack. The settings are collection variables, so no environment needs selecting.

  Run **0** and **1** in the Collection Runner, run the SQL commands from folder 1's description, then run **2** to **8** in one run. Roles aren't in login or register responses, so the scripts read them from the access token.
}
